Selected story/work item: `US-038 Data, auth, and tenancy foundation`  
Lane: high-risk, because this slice touches auth/authorization boundaries, scoped protected data delivery, and tenant isolation proof.

Implemented one bounded vertical slice:

- Added `executeStudentPortfolioPyramidQuery` in `app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/student-portfolio-pyramid-query.ts:52`.
  - Requires `student` role before row reads.
  - Requires class/fund/month scope before row reads.
  - Reads holdings through an injected row reader only.
  - Parses every row with the existing own-holding parser before delivery.
  - Rejects other-fund rows, duplicate tiers, incomplete/invalid snapshots, and invalid envelopes.
  - Returns only the existing safe student portfolio pyramid query result envelope.
- Added focused coverage in `app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/student-portfolio-pyramid-query.test.ts:48`.
  - Safe own-holding envelope path.
  - Non-student rejection before reads.
  - Missing fund-scope rejection before reads.
  - Other-fund holding rejection.
  - Incomplete holdings rejected without raw row delivery.
  - Duplicate tier rejection.

